## Authentication (better-auth)

### Configuration
- Located in `apps/backend/src/lib/auth.ts`.
- Plugins: `passkey`, `twoFactor`, `admin`, `emailHarmony`, `captcha`, `lastLoginMethod`, `openAPI`.

### Custom User Fields
- `callsign` (string): User's callsign
- `language` (string): Preferred language (bs, en, sr)
- `font` (string): Preferred font (sans, mono)
- `theme` (string): Preferred theme (dark, light)
- `style` (string): UI density style (relaxed, compact)

### Database Hooks
- `user.update.after`: Automatically accepts pending club invites when email is verified.

### Client Usage
- Use `authClient` from `@/lib/auth-client.ts`.
- Use `useIsAuthenticated()` hook to get current user and loading state.

