## Development Workflows

### Database Commands (run in apps/backend)
- `bun db:push`: Push schema directly to database (dev only)
- `bun db:studio`: Open Drizzle Studio GUI
- `bun db:seed`: Seed the database

### API Type Generation (run in apps/web)
- `bun run api:generate-types`: Fetches OpenAPI spec and generates TypeScript types.
- Pre-run automatically before `bun run dev` via `predev` script.

### Linting and Formatting
- `bun check`: Run Biome linting and formatting checks.
- Use Biome exclusively (no ESLint or Prettier).

